Placeholder so this folder exists in a clean checkout.

OpenCloudSDKTests has a CopyFiles build phase referencing doc/class-settings-sdk, and the build
fails with "lstat(.../doc/class-settings-sdk): No such file or directory" when it is absent.
The folder holds optional external documentation consumed by
SettingsTests/testUpdateConfigurationJSONFromMetadata via
OCClassSettingsDocumentationOptionExternalDocumentationFolders.
